            "title": "全球黄金ETF资产管理规模创纪录 机构：金价短期承压不改长期配置价值",
            "image": "",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260916A032XM00",
            "author": "萌虎出山",
            "pub_date": "2026-09-16 06:28:13",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section>【全球<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">黄金ETF</span></span></span><span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">资产管理规模</span></span></span>创纪录 机构：金价短期承压不改长期配置价值】财联社9月16日电，8月以来，黄金类ETF持续获得资金流入，截至9月14日，境内黄金相关ETF资金净流入超过百亿元。与此同时，8月全球实物黄金ETF资金净流入约180亿美元。近期，油价上涨及<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">美联储加息预期</span></span></span>升温令金价短期承压。但从中长期来看，多家机构认为，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">央行购金</span></span></span>、<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">储备多元化</span></span></span>和避险需求仍为黄金提供支撑。（上证报）</section></div>",
